  description:
  - The High Impact Stream Shooter was designed by the Tinkerer, allowing a more
    efficient and long range application of pressurized hydration.
  - Charging the gun will utilize its lock-on ability, allowing it to water multiple
    tiles at the cost of a single shot. Additionally, shots fired over a large distance
    have a larger splash radius.
  leftText: 
  rightText: Can be used to scan an untilled tile and display its nutrients to the
    user.
